 now been confirmed by Tara Reid  herself that it was her mother calling  in to Larry King's show to say that her  daughter had been sexually accosted by a  senator now again that doesn't make the  allegations true in and of themselves  but the point is one of type of fake  news that  exist is when the media ignores  something and because Joe Biden is a  Democrat because he's a lefty he gets a  pass from mainstream media where we know  if this was a conservative and we have  evidence of it in the case of Brett  Kavanaugh wouldn't get a pass and people  really need to wake up today see you let  me beat you a tweet from Alyssa Milano  she said I'm aware of the new  developments and Tara Reid's accusation  against Joe Biden I want Tara like every  other survivor to have the space to be  heard and seen without being used as  fodder I hear and see you tarus a  hashtag me too but really because Dave  in about 45 minutes or so I guess Joe  Biden is having a virtual Town Hall  about women's issues and we found out  that Hillary Clinton is going to be his  special guest and will be endorsing him  today yeah well we know this is just  nonsense I mean when when me two started  we had to believe all women and every  allegation was taken as simple fat then  when it goes against their guy I mean  Alyssa Milano she's been one of the  biggest pushers of the me2 thing now I  believe it was well intentioned but then  it sort of lost control and it's just  there to sort of take out everybody but  then when it's one of her guys well now  we have to think about it a little bit  more and I think this type of hypocrisy  is in many ways why we see mainstream  media collapsing because if you don't  call it as it is but you only call it as  you wish to be well then people are  gonna see that and this is sort of the  asymmetry that we now have with the  online media and what happens on YouTube  and Twitter and elsewhere and by the way  Fox is very good at this because you  guys actually cover the outlier stories  that the other networks ignore me Chuck  this is the type of thing that the New  York Times why has CNN not reported on  this story as far as I know as of us  right talking about this right now on  some on a video that happened on their  own network yeah I mean people start to  see it if you're looking for more honest  and thoughtful conversations about  politics instead of non-stop yelling  check out our politics playlist and if  you want to watch full interviews on a  variety of topics watch our full episode  playlists all right over here and to get  notified of all future videos be sure to  subscribe and click the notification  bell

